    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/a1e8bc6778c24f8a742b77e9b92b17c5.avif?t=1752548460\" width=574 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> is a classic style hand-crafted arcade bullet hell. Step in the shoes of a space-child that must embark on a bullet-ridden space odyssey to rescue his pets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NOTE: Best experienced with a controller!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOOT N WEAVE THROUGH SPACE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave and shoot through <strong>nine hand-crafted</strong> stages designed to challenge you until mastery and provide a colorful and distinct view while it's at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.poster.avif?t=1752548460\" width=584 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.webm?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.mp4?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/fda17e179dbe806f86a358084dcdd372.avif?t=1752548460\" width=616 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a spin on the classic <i><strong>FOCUS</strong></i> mode formula, <strong>SOLSTORM</strong> utilizes the <i>burst meter, </i>which while fulfilling the duties of the<i><strong> FOCUS</strong></i> meter found in many other bullet hells requires careful resource management to maximize it's effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.poster.avif?t=1752548460\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.webm?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.mp4?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tier of the meter provides different abilities and specials for your character, and you'll have to experiment to find the right opportunity to use them for both score maximization and stage survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery of the meter will be essential for surviving many of <strong>SOLSTORM</strong>'s stages and encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The right moment can hinge on one decision or spiral into disaster.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE PERFECTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> encourages replaying the stages for mastery, especially as the game gets more difficult and provides a <u>Replay Viewer</u> so you can analyze or share your runs with others! Rack up those score numbers and perfect clears!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER FOREWORD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> is fully independent game developed by a solo-developer featuring a <strong>custom game-engine</strong>, in addition to self-produced music, and art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who consider <strong>SOLSTORM</strong>, thank you for the support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c8d5926d8ff31ba6d5d706b2d94968e3.webp?t=1752548460\" width=32 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jerry Zhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/a1e8bc6778c24f8a742b77e9b92b17c5.avif?t=1752548460\" width=574 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> is a classic style hand-crafted arcade bullet hell. Step in the shoes of a space-child that must embark on a bullet-ridden space odyssey to rescue his pets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NOTE: Best experienced with a controller!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOOT N WEAVE THROUGH SPACE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave and shoot through <strong>nine hand-crafted</strong> stages designed to challenge you until mastery and provide a colorful and distinct view while it's at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.poster.avif?t=1752548460\" width=584 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.webm?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/04742c5774353164f87411d1f09f4b8f.mp4?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/fda17e179dbe806f86a358084dcdd372.avif?t=1752548460\" width=616 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a spin on the classic <i><strong>FOCUS</strong></i> mode formula, <strong>SOLSTORM</strong> utilizes the <i>burst meter, </i>which while fulfilling the duties of the<i><strong> FOCUS</strong></i> meter found in many other bullet hells requires careful resource management to maximize it's effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.poster.avif?t=1752548460\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.webm?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c7833ad1c06d637b5b8ea6f33c81e00d.mp4?t=1752548460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tier of the meter provides different abilities and specials for your character, and you'll have to experiment to find the right opportunity to use them for both score maximization and stage survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery of the meter will be essential for surviving many of <strong>SOLSTORM</strong>'s stages and encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The right moment can hinge on one decision or spiral into disaster.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE PERFECTION!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> encourages replaying the stages for mastery, especially as the game gets more difficult and provides a <u>Replay Viewer</u> so you can analyze or share your runs with others! Rack up those score numbers and perfect clears!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER FOREWORD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLSTORM</strong> is fully independent game developed by a solo-developer featuring a <strong>custom game-engine</strong>, in addition to self-produced music, and art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who consider <strong>SOLSTORM</strong>, thank you for the support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572660/extras/c8d5926d8ff31ba6d5d706b2d94968e3.webp?t=1752548460\" width=32 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jerry Zhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
